WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:11.040
It’s project time! Make a ScratchJr relay race: three runners, each started by a message from the one before, and a celebration at the end.

2
00:00:11.040 --> 00:00:13.160
Three runners take turns.

3
00:00:13.160 --> 00:00:16.150
Each one sends a message to start the next.

4
00:00:16.150 --> 00:00:20.730
Use a red message for runner 2 and a blue message for runner 3.

5
00:00:20.730 --> 00:00:27.670
The last runner says “We win!” and hops to celebrate.

6
00:00:27.670 --> 00:00:29.940
Does each runner wait for its turn?

7
00:00:29.940 --> 00:00:31.060
Fix any colour mix-ups.

8
00:00:31.060 --> 00:00:38.280
Final runner (👆 start on tap = gets the message): run right 4, say “We win!”, hop 2 times.

9
00:00:38.280 --> 00:00:41.840
The snail brings it home!

10
00:00:41.840 --> 00:00:44.190
Great work! Let’s remember what we learned.

11
00:00:44.190 --> 00:00:48.710
Now plan it, build it, test it, and share it!
